aff.az.gov/1923/Parks","source_title":"Parks | City of Flagstaff","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"City parks are open daily from sunrise to 10 p.m.; bring your own equipment and do not reserve specialized facilities.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"flagstaff-mcpherson-park-pickleball","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"McPherson Park","title":"Rally at McPherson Park","subtitle":"1650 N Turquoise Drive · Flagstaff","notes":"Bring your own racquets or a ball, use an open court, and keep the session casual so others can share the space.","short_summary":"A city park with tennis courts, a basketball court, and disc golf.","evidence_claim":"The City of Flagstaff lists tennis courts, a basketball court, and a disc-golf course at McPherson Park; basic drop-in park amenities should remain free.","source_url":"https://flagstaff.az.gov/1923/Parks","source_title":"Parks | City of Flagstaff","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"City parks are open daily from sunrise to 10 p.m.; use only unreserved, basic drop-in amenities.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"flagstaff-ponderosa-park-courts","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Ponderosa Park","title":"Set up a casual game at Ponderosa Park","subtitle":"2512 N First Street · Flagstaff","notes":"Bring your own ball or racquets, choose an open court, and make a short, informal game around the park’s listed amenities.","short_summary":"A city park with pickleball, tennis, volleyball, and basketball courts.","evidence_claim":"The City of Flagstaff lists pickleball, tennis, sand-volleyball, and basketball courts at Ponderosa Park; basic drop-in park amenities should remain free.","source_url":"https://flagstaff.az.gov/1923/Parks","source_title":"Parks | City of Flagstaff","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"City parks are open daily from sunrise to 10 p.m.; use basic drop-in courts and bring any needed equipment.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
